# Every species has fixed parts plus 8 Heritage Traits picked from one shared pool (feature type HT, 107 traits).
# The picker takes each trait once, so the effect for taking a trait a second time is written in the text of the trait ("Second pick").
# Engine fx used: dark, speed, moves. Skill proficiencies, resistances and the like are text only, because the species option fx has no fixed skill or resistance key.
PB = "Uses equal your Proficiency Bonus per Long Rest."
PB2 = "Uses equal twice your Proficiency Bonus per Long Rest."
LR = "Regained on a Long Rest."
SR = "Regained on a Short Rest or Long Rest."
